From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: elixxli <elixxli@tencent.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:21:30 +0800
Subject: fix(ohos): stop frame monitoring while paused

Backport upstream #1794 in full: fix the OnPause guard and report the
actual hitch duration and frame count instead of repeating total duration.
Ark adds a host fixture using the production monitor and NativeVSync stubs,
including distinct duration, frame-count and hitch-time assertions.
The upstream fix was merged on 2026-10-13; this does not establish a cause
or fix for the separately reported multi-second UI stall.

(cherry picked from commit 394993f188384e4d9d6233afcc41497f415b0bcf)
